                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "You play as a robot who unlike many others has consciousness and you need to escape the robot factory or you'll get destroyed. You're probably gonna die many times but there are save (check) points from which you will continue. \nI played on keyboard which is more challenging, having controller makes things easier. You can remap the keys if you don't like default. \nThere are upgrades for health & energy, laser weapons, double jump etc. most of them you can collect along the way, some are in hidden areas of the map. You'll encounter many traps and puzzles, variety of enemies and also some challenging bosses. \nEnemies can hit hard, try not to go melee on them or you'll lose your entire health in no time. Some flying enemies can have longer laser range than you so you need to be careful on that as well. \nLevels are nicely done, i like the cartoonish graphics and i enjoyed in soundtrack. No difficulty settings or windows mode but alt-enter does the trick. Only 4 achievements but you get 100% once you beat the game. \n\nOverall you'll have few hours of fun in this cute little platform. Recommended.",
